      </p>
      <p>
        While the clinical content is medically directed and reviewed by Dr. Ubirajara Barroso, Jr., MD, PhD, and other medical professionals, it is <strong>not</strong> intended to be a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. 
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Never disregard professional medical advice or delay in seeking it because of something you have read on this website.</li>
